  "description": "Seung-chan, who had been struggling to make ends meet on his meagre graduate student’s salary, was delighted when a friend introduced him to a high-paying tutoring job—but his joy was short-lived. The student’s father turned out to be Ho-won, with whom he had had a bitter falling-out during his school days. As he began the lessons, putting his discomfort aside, something completely unexpected happened… How will this relationship end?\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/rema), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/rema)",
